index 286696f..c140f2f 100644
--- a/audit/FINDINGS.md
+++ b/audit/FINDINGS.md
@@ -2983,3 +2983,125 @@ guard could not see it. That is not the guard being naive — **it is reading
 hrefs statically, the same way a crawler does.** A route that only ever appears
